  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Application:</strong> Sudoku - Hlavolamy</p>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 17, 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Sudoku - Hlavolamy
  handles information when you use our mobile game.</p>

  <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>The game stores information such as puzzle progress,
  settings, achievements and game statistics locally
  on your device.</p>
  <p>The game uses Google AdMob to display advertisements.
  Google and its advertising partners may collect device
  identifiers, IP addresses, advertising interaction data
  and other information as described in their policies.</p>

  <h2>3. Advertising</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdMob, which may provide personalised
  or non-personalised advertisements depending on your
  location, choices and applicable privacy requirements.</p>
  <p>For information about Google's data practices, visit
  <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">
  Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>4. Consent and Privacy Choices</h2>
  <p>Where required, the application requests advertising
  consent through Google's User Messaging Platform (UMP).
  Users may choose the available consent options.
  Where applicable, users must also be able to revisit
  their privacy choices.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Storage</h2>
  <p>Game progress and preferences are stored locally
  on the device. Removing the application may delete
  locally stored game data.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>Advertising-related information may be processed
  by Google and its advertising partners to provide,
  measure and improve advertisements.</p>

  <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>The game is intended for a general audience.
  We do not knowingly collect personal information
  directly from children. Advertising and consent
  handling must follow applicable age-related rules.</p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps to protect information
  processed in connection with the application.
  No method of electronic processing is completely secure.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when the
  application or applicable requirements change.
  Updates will be published on this page.</p>

